    {
      "id": 491774,
      "username": "UsmanSanawar",
      "name": "Usman",
      "created_at": "2026-01-19T11:51:34.712Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Following up on this post, I’d like to update.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/white_check_mark.png?v=15\" title=\":white_check_mark:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":white_check_mark:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> <strong>Unicode has officially released the new Saudi Riyal currency symbol</strong>, which means it can be used directly in ERPNext <strong>without any custom fonts, installations, or technical workarounds</strong>.</p>\n<p>You can now apply the new ⃁ symbol in ERPNext using <strong>either of the following standard methods</strong>:</p>\n<p><strong>Option 1: Direct Copy &amp; Paste</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>\n<p>Go to <strong>Currency</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Open <strong>SAR</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>In the <strong>Currency Symbol</strong> field, directly <strong>copy and paste the new Saudi Riyal symbol</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Save</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">⃁\n</code></pre>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/0/e0295a5d2d36602ab5f503248d40ab5f76d045d3.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/e0295a5d2d36602ab5f503248d40ab5f76d045d3\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e0295a5d2d36602ab5f503248d40ab5f76d045d3_2_488x375.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"vZ1ycTgPA2JjiXDrvlZv1MD0wBJ\" width=\"488\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e0295a5d2d36602ab5f503248d40ab5f76d045d3_2_488x375.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e0295a5d2d36602ab5f503248d40ab5f76d045d3_2_732x562.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/0/e0295a5d2d36602ab5f503248d40ab5f76d045d3_2_976x750.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2247×1725 188 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<h4><a name=\"p-491774-option-2-unicode-entry-1\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491774-option-2-unicode-entry-1\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a><strong>Option 2: Unicode Entry</strong></h4>\n<p>Alternatively, you can enter the Unicode value directly:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-auto\">&amp;#x20C1;\n</code></pre>\n<p>Use this value in the <strong>Currency Symbol</strong> field for SAR and save the record.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/f/0/f0e3cf52fb217b236b87a803cf4832289d163cb8.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/f0e3cf52fb217b236b87a803cf4832289d163cb8\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/0/f0e3cf52fb217b236b87a803cf4832289d163cb8_2_477x375.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"yn0FK5StqgSb0okLYgagr19AOog\" width=\"477\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/0/f0e3cf52fb217b236b87a803cf4832289d163cb8_2_477x375.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/0/f0e3cf52fb217b236b87a803cf4832289d163cb8_2_715x562.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/f/0/f0e3cf52fb217b236b87a803cf4832289d163cb8_2_954x750.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FAFAF9\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">2193×1722 192 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<hr>\n<h3><a name=\"p-491774-key-notes-2\" class=\"anchor\" href=\"#p-491774-key-notes-2\" aria-label=\"Heading link\"></a>Key Notes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>This works natively in ERPNext</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>No custom fonts are required</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Fully standards-compliant using official Unicode support</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Suitable for invoices, print formats, reports, and PDFs (subject to font support)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>This update simplifies adoption significantly and aligns ERPNext implementations with the officially recognized Saudi currency symbol.</p>\n<p>Hope this helps the community <img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/images/emoji/twitter/+1.png?v=15\" title=\":+1:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":+1:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"><br>\nFeel free to reach out if anyone faces font-rendering issues in PDFs or print formats.</p>",
