      "cooked": "<p><strong>Option 1: Direct Copy &amp; Paste</strong><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/4/64131a03e9ab9c7759bf177e4007ce21cbec98e5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/64131a03e9ab9c7759bf177e4007ce21cbec98e5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/6/4/64131a03e9ab9c7759bf177e4007ce21cbec98e5.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"ehiFFtTvTujHshQftZel7nmyHPL\" width=\"690\" height=\"98\" data-dominant-color=\"FDFDFD\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">779×111 3.78 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<strong>Result:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/c/bcd90f498d2cae83f48f7a81fd9697f24cda16b5.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"qWCOob0qcPONUJggF3uGaPawLpH\" width=\"254\" height=\"80\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><strong>Option 2: Unicode Entry</strong><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/e/2e4fdac5b4806f6419db4973fda23e39f9520a06.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/2e4fdac5b4806f6419db4973fda23e39f9520a06\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/e/2e4fdac5b4806f6419db4973fda23e39f9520a06_2_690x90.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"6BH3b9hgqai4uZ5FG5nLxfuEARw\" width=\"690\" height=\"90\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/2/e/2e4fdac5b4806f6419db4973fda23e39f9520a06_2_690x90.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/e/2e4fdac5b4806f6419db4973fda23e39f9520a06.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/e/2e4fdac5b4806f6419db4973fda23e39f9520a06.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"FCFCFC\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">783×103 4.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div><br>\n<strong>Result:</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/2/226bd83ef75b3076322a64c8c9c6c443eefd6d92.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"4UvhZC9m543eL8pLsIusQpG7uo2\" width=\"192\" height=\"80\"></p>",
